      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Hardcoded AAD in AES-GCM (`bootrom.cc`)** You have hardcoded the Additional Authenticated Data (AAD):\n\n```c\nuint8_t AAD[4] \u003d { 0x01, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00 };\n```\n\n* **Feedback:** If this is a protocol requirement for the bootrom, add a brief comment explaining *why* this specific AAD is used so future maintainers do not assume it\u0027s leftover debug code.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 155,
        "startChar": 1,
