      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T17:13:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Firmware Size Override Out-of-Bounds Read (`et171_flash.cc`)** When handling the `-size` argument, the tool forces the read size:\n\n```c\nfw_size \u003d (fw_size_override \u003e 0) ? fw_size_override : fw_size;\nstd::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e firmware(fw_size);\nif (!infile.read(reinterpret_cast\u003cchar *\u003e(firmware.data()), fw_size)) { ... }\n```\n\n* **Risk:** If a user specifies a `-size` larger than the actual file size, `infile.read()` will fail, and the program will abort. While it fails safely, the UX is poor.  \n* **Remediation:** Add a check to ensure `fw_size_override` does not exceed the actual file size on disk before attempting the read.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 175,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 193,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "02e7aba6221e427ee896ab011f1564dc64af6f53",
